ys rugby supports that sport. Missing credibility metadata is not wrong_argument. Return direct only for the requested relation; UK Albums Chart does not define the band or song whose debut is mentioned.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the population of Gniewkowo?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0065-009ad1444e70:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 161, \"text\": \"Gmina Gniewkowo Gmina Gniewkowo is an urban-rural gmina (administrative district) in Inowrocław County, Kuyavian-Pomeranian Voivodeship, in north-central Poland.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0065-009ad1444e70:d00\", \"start\": 162, \"end\": 271, \"text\": \"Its seat is the town of Gniewkowo, which lies approximately north-east of Inowrocław and south-west of Toruń.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0065-009ad1444e70:d00\", \"start\": 272, \"end\": 468, \"text\": \"The gmina covers an area of , and as of 2006 its total population is 14,719 (out of which the population of Gniewkowo amounts to 7,254, and the population of the rural part of the gmina is 7,465).\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0065-009ad1444e70:d00\", \"start\": 469, \"end\": 675, \"text\": \"Apart from the town of Gniewkowo, Gmina Gniewkowo contains the villages and settlements of Bąbolin, Branno, Buczkowo, Chrząstowo, Dąblin, Gąski, Godzięba, Kaczkowo, Kawęczyn, Kępa Kujawska, Kijewo, Klepary,\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0065-009ad1444e70:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 323, \"text\": \"nL����14p�\\u0000 , �0 D�Gi �В\\u0014�����Q\\u00107 ��8 -- ���k '' ���k|�t=tH���Ex �w2ޟ�� > -E\\u0017���H\\u0017�B����ą ������X�w�w } � U % V�VU����W % \\u00043C�� ` ��ۉM����\\\\k\\b� �FHn�x�j # �L��9\\u001b [ ��9��-X|�'wm '' ����n߷��\\u0012��\\u0018\\u0010|�3 ( ǚ X� < �\\u0001�\\u0015�Gr �\\u001a�F���\\u001a�ԣUY��� ] ��� ����y��HJH�\\u000f�5�rW� \\u0017a @ V� , Vm�D